      "text": "Leave me alone! Looks like I triggered a whole lot of people because I voted RED and voted for every Republican on my ballot!\n\nI was told that as a Black man, my Black vote is powerful. I was told to get out and exercise my right to vote because my voice matters.\n\nWell, guess what? I DID EXACTLY THAT!\n\nI took my powerful Black vote straight to the polls and voted REPUBLICAN!\n\nNow suddenly people are upset with me for exercising the very same right they kept telling me to exercise!\n\nSo let me get this straight. My Black vote is powerful only when I vote the way YOU want me to vote?\n\nThat’s not how democracy works!\n\nI don’t owe anybody my vote, and I don’t need anybody’s permission to vote Republican.\n\nMy Black vote. My choice. My right. Get over it!",
